<article>
<h1>Admin guide</h1>
<p class="lead">How to connect services and combine their endpoints into one endpoint for web and mobile apps. No coding needed.</p>
<p class="hint">Every example here uses the sample data (the mock services and <code>samples/config</code>), so you can try it as you read. Each section links to its <strong>full guide</strong>, which shows every answer in full and is checked against the mock services.</p>
